Package: hscl-cqhecs
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: all
Section: science
Priority: optional
Depends: hscl-base, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv
Maintainer: HCSMEDIA <noreply@hcsmedia.invalid>
Description: CQ-HECS Studio launcher for HSCL1 (app shell, no runtime included)
 A small launcher and status command for the CQ-HECS classical quantum-circuit
 simulator. The package ships no Python wheels and makes no network access:
 the isolated runtime (/opt/hscl/venvs/cqhecs) is a separate, explicit step.
 Nothing starts automatically. CQ-HECS is a classical circuit simulator, not
 a quantum-chemistry or molecular-dynamics solver.
 Made with love by hcsmedia.
